This repository patches FastVideo (https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

fastvideo/models/dits/h3fast/vsa_primitives.cuh is a copy of FastVideo's
fastvideo-kernel/csrc/attention/primitives.cuh (commit a01c50a) with one function added.
fastvideo/models/dits/h3fast/vsa_fp8.cuh and vsa_pair.cuh are derived from FastVideo's
fastvideo-kernel/csrc/attention/block_sparse_kernel_blackwell.cuh. patches/fastvideo-a01c50a.patch modifies FastVideo
source files. The header of each derived file describes its changes.

Model weights are not included; each FastVideo / MiniMax checkpoint carries its own license.
